<title>BELGIUM: BMT buys last 30 pct of German Omco.</title>
<headline>BMT buys last 30 pct of German Omco.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian metals group BMT NV said on Tuesday it had acquired the remaining 30 percent of glass moulds producer Omco Formenbau GmbH from German glass producer Gerresheimer Glas AG.</p>
<p>BMT bought the first 70 pct of Omco in December 1991.</p>
<p>It gave no financial details of the deal which will take effect from July 1.</p>
<p>-- Bert Lauwers, Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6815, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
